    "Operate gamification features (points, badges, leaderboards, mini-games, rewards).",
    "Send operational emails: account invitations, password resets, deadline reminders, class notifications.",
    "Provide customer support and handle contracts, payments, and service renewals.",
    "Secure the system, detect fraud, and improve product quality.",
    "We do not sell personal data. Data is shared only in the following cases:",
    "Within your own workspace: HR, administrators, and direct managers may view the learning progress and results of staff within their own business. Data between workspaces is fully isolated."
